{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function hotkeySequence(sequence, options?): <T>(proto, methodName, descriptor) => void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/decorators/hotkey-sequence.ts#L30","children":[{"type":"text","value":"decorators/hotkey-sequence.ts:30"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Decorator that registers a keyboard sequence (e.g. Vim-style) on the element\nwhen it connects and unregisters when it disconnects. Uses\n"},{"type":"link","href":"../classes/HotkeySequenceController.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"HotkeySequenceController"}]},{"type":"text","value":" under the hood."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"sequence","children":[{"type":"text","value":"sequence"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HotkeySequence"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The key sequence to listen for (e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"['G', 'G']"},{"type":"text","value":" for \"g g\")."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SequenceOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HOTKEY_SEQUENCE_DEFAULT_OPTIONS"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional sequence options (target, timeout, enabled, etc.)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A method decorator for use on LitElement methods."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":">("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"proto"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"methodName"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"descriptor"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"class MyElement extends LitElement {\n  @hotkeySequence(['G', 'G'])\n  goToTop() { window.scrollTo(0, 0) }\n\n  @hotkeySequence(['D', 'D'], { timeout: 500 })\n  deleteLine() { this.deleteCurrentLine() }\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"sequence","text":"sequence","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction hotkeySequence(sequence, options?): <T>(proto, methodName, descriptor) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [decorators/hotkey-sequence.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/decorators/hotkey-sequence.ts#L30)\n\nDecorator that registers a keyboard sequence (e.g. Vim-style) on the element\nwhen it connects and unregisters when it disconnects. Uses\n[HotkeySequenceController](../classes/HotkeySequenceController.md) under the hood.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### sequence\n\n`HotkeySequence`\n\nThe key sequence to listen for (e.g. `['G', 'G']` for \"g g\").\n\n### options?\n\n`SequenceOptions` = `HOTKEY_SEQUENCE_DEFAULT_OPTIONS`\n\nOptional sequence options (target, timeout, enabled, etc.).\n\n## Returns\n\nA method decorator for use on LitElement methods.\n\n\\<`T`\\>(`proto`, `methodName`, `descriptor`) => `void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass MyElement extends LitElement {\n  @hotkeySequence(['G', 'G'])\n  goToTop() { window.scrollTo(0, 0) }\n\n  @hotkeySequence(['D', 'D'], { timeout: 500 })\n  deleteLine() { this.deleteCurrentLine() }\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: hotkeySequence\ntitle: hotkeySequence\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction hotkeySequence(sequence, options?): <T>(proto, methodName, descriptor) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [decorators/hotkey-sequence.ts:30](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/decorators/hotkey-sequence.ts#L30)\n\nDecorator that registers a keyboard sequence (e.g. Vim-style) on the element\nwhen it connects and unregisters when it disconnects. Uses\n[HotkeySequenceController](../classes/HotkeySequenceController.md) under the hood.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### sequence\n\n`HotkeySequence`\n\nThe key sequence to listen for (e.g. `['G', 'G']` for \"g g\").\n\n### options?\n\n`SequenceOptions` = `HOTKEY_SEQUENCE_DEFAULT_OPTIONS`\n\nOptional sequence options (target, timeout, enabled, etc.).\n\n## Returns\n\nA method decorator for use on LitElement methods.\n\n\\<`T`\\>(`proto`, `methodName`, `descriptor`) => `void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass MyElement extends LitElement {\n  @hotkeySequence(['G', 'G'])\n  goToTop() { window.scrollTo(0, 0) }\n\n  @hotkeySequence(['D', 'D'], { timeout: 500 })\n  deleteLine() { this.deleteCurrentLine() }\n}\n```\n"}
